<title>UK: Eve Group gets deals worth over 6.5 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Eve Group gets deals worth over 6.5 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>British civil engineering firm Eve Group Plc said on Thursday its Eve Transmission unit had been awarded a series of power and telecommunications contracts worth over 6.5 million stg.</p>
<p>The largest deal, valued at over 5.0 million stg, was a refurbishment contract for British electricity network operator National Grid Group Plc.</p>
<p>Eve said it also secured several other contracts for transmission lines with various regional electricity companies.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
